// Symbols not present in the vanilla mkb2.us.lst, used by this mod's assembly code.
// This file is concatenated with mkb2.us.lst before being passed to elf2rel,
// so re-exporting mkb2.us.lst does not clobber these entries.
//
// Section bases (vanilla US): text=0x80270100 data=0x80444160 bss=0x8054C8E0

